sequenceDiagram
    participant FE
    participant CM as client-management
    participant CD as consultation-document repo
    participant DB as MongoDB

    FE->>CM: POST /:id/consultation-documents { documents: [...] }
    CM->>DB: getClientById + isUserAuthorizedWithClient
    CM->>CM: validate each document_key belongs to client/team
    CM->>CM: existing count + new count > cap?
    alt over cap
        CM-->>FE: 409 { message }
    else within cap
        CM->>CD: insertMany(consultation_document)
        CM->>DB: findByIdAndUpdate(profile, $push)
        CM-->>FE: 201 { data: { documents } }
    end
